      "text": "API\n\nPOST /v1/quotes\nPOST /v1/rides\nGET /v1/rides/{id}\nPOST /v1/rides/{id}/cancel\nGET /v1/rides/{id}/events (SSE)\nPOST /internal/vehicles/{id}/telemetry\n\nIdempotency-Key + trace ID",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API\n\nPOST /v1/quotes\nPOST /v1/rides\nGET /v1/rides/{id}\nPOST /v1/rides/{id}/cancel\nGET /v1/rides/{id}/events (SSE)\nPOST /internal/vehicles/{id}/telemetry\n\nIdempotency-Key + trace ID",
