      "updated": 1786035378154,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "REQUESTED → MATCHING → RESERVED\n→ VEHICLE_EN_ROUTE → ARRIVED\n→ RIDER_ONBOARD → IN_PROGRESS\n→ COMPLETED\n\nTerminal: CANCELLED, FAILED, SAFETY_STOP\n\nCommands include expectedVersion.\nOutbox couples DB state and events.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "REQUESTED → MATCHING → RESERVED\n→ VEHICLE_EN_ROUTE → ARRIVED\n→ RIDER_ONBOARD → IN_PROGRESS\n→ COMPLETED\n\nTerminal: CANCELLED, FAILED, SAFETY_STOP\n\nCommands include expectedVersion.\nOutbox couples DB state and events.",
