      "locked": false,
      "text": "H3/S2 + exact road ETA\n\nPros\n• Fast bounded lookup\n• Ring expansion\n• Natural partitioning\n• Adaptive resolution\n\nCons\n• Boundary artifacts\n• Cell distance ≠ travel time\n• Hot downtown cells\n\nMitigate with neighbors, subshards, and route refinement.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "H3/S2 + exact road ETA\n\nPros\n• Fast bounded lookup\n• Ring expansion\n• Natural partitioning\n• Adaptive resolution\n\nCons\n• Boundary artifacts\n• Cell distance ≠ travel time\n• Hot downtown cells\n\nMitigate with neighbors, subshards, and route refinement.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-Ek_I-0n4RGf6RpHLuQG9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5658.435363204833,
      "y": -13259.308977976256,
      "width": 171.5358428955078,
      "height": 20,
